    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp local-id=\"b08fc7f3e529\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"87e48b0bef19\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeneral flow\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"028057691caf\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"20b4983dc0f3\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"922a8ad9406c\"\u003eIn initial check request should be recorded TID from EasyPay and calculated amount from liability and its fine amount (row by row)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"c3173edd62fe\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4a66b08232ed\"\u003eIn pay confirm request should firstly to check amount if it is same as calculated in initial check request\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"ab54ee3608ff\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4855ca28a6b2\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4bb6685a4ff4\"\u003eIf different return an error and don\u0026rsquo;t receive payment\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"599c91045d49\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"45c760371345\"\u003eit\u0026rsquo;s possible pay only all liabilities together if was checked combine liabilities Checkbox in Collection channel\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"bc8f055b3b77\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"88c4bbb0b709\"\u003eit\u0026rsquo;s possible pay each liability + fine (by order with due date) if was checked combine liabilities Checkbox in Collection channel. in this case it\u0026rsquo;s possible got total amount  separately per liability + fine \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"a6c1ea5b5d20\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6e2cbce15482\"\u003eif amount is same should register Payment in system  \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"e3e4ff8d77d1\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8ba96a7d6c48\"\u003eAfter payment creation should start liability covering; Firstly should start covering liabilities and then to start creation \u003cstrong\u003eLate payment fines \u003c/strong\u003eand then its liabilities and then to start covering  liabilities creation from LPFs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"53993f8f44e6\" /\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"7d5d2613ba0d\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"0bb1de953d36\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d82d2fbb5644\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLiability covering flow:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"ba0a99a8a8a3\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"d56706bb4a36\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f96acea61da8\"\u003eFor each liability to check if liability current amount (saved value from check request) is same or different than liability current amount(recalculated when pay confirm request came)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"c2fa60431ef0\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"5aad5b473965\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f877740c8b41\"\u003eif they are same - should cover liability fully\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4a3c04f25d45\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b75e4a3e945f\"\u003eif recalculated amount is less  - should cover liability and create receivable \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"81f99bae0880\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6ae3d492935c\"\u003eif recalculated amount is more - shouldn\u0026rsquo;t cover liability and only create receivable \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"7ac55fb2b932\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"fd1cd076e81e\"\u003efully cover date in all cases should be \u003cstrong\u003echeck request date\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6354e4a73437\" /\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"f2b9e1ff981f\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"61bdfb91edfe\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"dce3b2c43c34\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStart LPF generation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"e702afea5b90\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"abfac32ceec4\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"77ce044efcee\"\u003eAfter all liabilities are covered should \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"373d1ecdd431\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d24e5680b778\"\u003eShould recalculate LPF with Date of \u003cstrong\u003echeck request date \u003c/strong\u003eand create all LPF objects for liabilities which was overdue\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"501c0ee83331\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1afed0712457\"\u003eAfter LPF creation should create liabilities for generated LPF objects  and should start covering newly created liabilities one by one. For each newly created liability compare LPF amount calculated on check request date:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"75f2c9823228\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"91d7213c8770\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"318c9515676e\"\u003eif they are same - should cover liability fully\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"5317d2ee469f\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"e448e9dcf721\"\u003eif recalculated LPF amount is less  - should cover liability and create receivable \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"47ba0b73fea0\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b0439589f10f\"\u003eif recalculated LPF amount is more - shouldn\u0026rsquo;t cover liability and only create receivable \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"65689a91f2f8\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"937178c492ea\"\u003eLogics for creating LPF:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"27bee829a899\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"9ec6cd28d0ac\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d0753c323625\"\u003eAmount = recalculated amount\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"5058a12477e9\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"446c9c63c67e\"\u003eLogical Date =  \u003cstrong\u003echeck request date\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ea5fc6c86258\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"74b2178f7b73\"\u003eDue date = from payment term from interim\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b7263bc3eb2a\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b114102af168\"\u003eLogics for creating liability: \u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"6fcb43b4bf1c\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"83cff468745f\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"27ffcd9f7bcb\"\u003eAmount = recalculated amount\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"02e558ccbf89\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"70ab6c10f0ad\"\u003eLogical date =\u003cstrong\u003echeck request date\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"758f5c41e7bc\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8eb252c08fea\"\u003eDue date = from LPF\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"cfdc9644b496\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"07d416234a02\"\u003eDate of full offset=\u003cstrong\u003echeck request date\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"36ffa5fb0caa\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0964c5153306\"\u003eoccurrence date= \u003cstrong\u003echeck request date\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a124ec7be1a5\"\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(7,71,166);\"\u003eConfiguration\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"e0bfb5618954\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(7,71,166);\"\u003eTo implement Easy Pay payment, the integration uses two parameters: Merchant ID and Secret key.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b6a65fa80b9c\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(7,71,166);\"\u003eThe values ââof these parameters are set on the system configuration page \u0026quot;EasyPay Integration\u0026quot;. (1)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"3f4589f160c2\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f43e81e4fd1b\"\u003eSee detail examples\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"media-group\"\u003e\u003cac:structured-macro ac:name=\"view-file\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:local-id=\"b19de5eccfe4\" ac:macro-id=\"6a2d4bd5-7bc2-499c-9c2b-afb4e4d871a7\"\u003e\u003cac:parameter ac:name=\"name\"\u003e\u003cri:attachment ri:filename=\"Online Payment cases.xlsx\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/ac:parameter\u003e\u003c/ac:structured-macro\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"e95843042f9d\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2e7863b72fc7\" /\u003e\u003ch2 loc