and Merchant ID were hardcoded into the code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" ac:local-id=\"b6a1a457-9259-444c-8b7e-990ff4ec8055\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"e16bc0b33943\"\u003eIn Phase 2, the Secret Key and Merchant ID were written into the configuration and are editable by the user.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"946088c6db4a\"\u003e\u003cac:link ac:local-id=\"302c6337428e\" ac:card-appearance=\"inline\"\u003e\u003cri:page ri:content-title=\"Configuration - Easy pay\" ri:version-at-save=\"4\" /\u003e\u003cac:link-body\u003eConfiguration - Easy pay\u003c/ac:link-body\u003e\u003c/ac:link\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" ac:local-id=\"4c19501c-8053-4ee2-b7c9-917be4ae5de3\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"ac69b0d0a717\"\u003eConfiguration page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd data-highlight-colour=\"#ffffff\" ac:local-id=\"f1cfe5be-8e0f-4760-b87a-7b5d63d04144\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6e23d4383dce\"\u003e\u003cac:link ac:local-id=\"9a11be301ff2\" ac:card-appearance=\"inline\"\u003e\u003cri:page ri:content-title=\"Configuration page\" ri:version-at-save=\"24\" /\u003e\u003cac:link-body\u003eConfiguration page\u003c/ac:link-body\u003e\u003c/ac:link\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b5d22e63e32c\" /\u003e",
